     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br>El viernes, 7 de noviembre de 2014 02:43:31 UTC+11, Joe Cheng [RStudio]  escribió:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Yeah, I don&#39;t understand several things about this example--a minimal example at least of the server.R would help a lot. I&#39;m almost positive there&#39;s no reason to assign output$results each time though.</p>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Nov 5, 2014 10:01 PM, &quot;Jose Magaña&quot; &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">jose.a...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br type=\"attribution\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I am trying to put some order in my code because I need to implement a huge application and I am creating functions from chunks of code to improve readibility and favour reuse.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I have an issue when trying to do so with renderTable.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">My original call cannot be fully converted to a function, the renderTable must stay outside:</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.8048000335693px;background:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:inherit;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"background:transparent\">  renderResults </span><span style=\"background:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139);background:transparent\">function</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">objectives</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background:transparent\">{</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);background:transparent\">#    renderTable({</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n      d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">data.frame</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">Result</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">objectives</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n      d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">format</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">big.mark</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> scientific</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">FALSE</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n      d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">1</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">]&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">paste</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&#39;$&#39;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">1</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">])</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n      d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">1</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,]&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">paste</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&quot;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">1</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,],</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n      rownames</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">1</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">]&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">paste</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&quot;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">rownames</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">d</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">1</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">],</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n      d\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);background:transparent\">#    }, align=&#39;lr&#39;,sanitize.text.function = function(x) x)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"background:transparent\">}</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">and be called:</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:17.8048000335693px;background:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;white-space:inherit;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"background:transparent\">  output</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">$</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">results </span><span style=\"background:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> \r\n  renderTable</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n    renderResults</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">scalc</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">()$</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">Objectives</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">\r\n  </span><span style=\"background:transparent\">},</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> align</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0);background:transparent\">&#39;lr&#39;</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">sanitize.text.function </span><span style=\"background:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,139);background:transparent\">function</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">x</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background:transparent\"> x</span><span style=\"background:transparent\">)</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">what is not exactly what I wanted because I need to set the options each time.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I have also tried with observe aassuming that someone needs to check when scalc(), that is reactive, changes but they don&#39;t work either.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Is there any way to improve this? What is so special on renderXXX functions that this doesn&#39;t work? I guess is related to scoping but I don&#39;t get it.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I have managed to solve it including output$results generation inside scalc() but<span style=\"line-height:17.8048000335693px\"> only works if I keep another output that I generate from scalc() using renderDataTable outside scalc(). If both outputs are generated inside then I get no output. There are only two outputs in the app. The second output generated with renderDataTable depends on another reactive variable: change() Both variables get triggered from the same button. I suspect the outputs are by default also reactive element that requires a trigger.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I know it&#39;s a bit confusing, I can try to prepare a minimum code that helps to reproduce the problem.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;line-height:17.8048000335693px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I am using R 3.1.1 on R studio 0.98, with shiny 0.10.0 and Windows 7</p></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegr